SELECTCASE ARGS
CASE "NAS.trivia.ArmTeck"
    SELECTCASE AL_LANGUAGE
    CASE "eng"
        RETURNF @"ArmTeck Incorporated is an American weapons manufacturer that manufactures firearms such as the SPA automatic rifle (for which the Vandal is based off of), the next-generation MP-NG pistol, MR-NG rifle, and MM-NG machine gun. Other notable equipment are their AC armor carrior vests, BH ballistic helments, and the DGL-103 grenade launcher."
    ENDSELECT
CASE "NAS.trivia.ArmTeck.SPA"
    SELECTCASE AL_LANGUAGE
    CASE "eng"
	    RETURNF @"During the 1960s, ArmTeck saw the opportunity to create an automatic rifle to arm third world millitaries. The Special Purpose Automatic rifle uses a then unique system where a short piston is pushed by the gases produced by the 5.56x45mm cartridge. This design would be used by the Japanese licensed copy, the Haru Type 89, and the Gensokyan immitation of the SPA, the YMKA Vandal. "
    ENDSELECT
CASE "NAS.trivia.gryzov"
    SELECTCASE AL_LANGUAGE
    CASE "eng"
        RETURNF @"Gryzov Group was created in 2011 when the Renov Manufacturing Plant and State Defense Committee Plant 622 merged together to form the Russian manufacutring superpower. The Avtomat Gryzov-series of rifles, mainly the AG-16 serve as the Russian's main service weapon."
    ENDSELECT
CASE "NAS.trivia.gryzov.SVG49"
    SELECTCASE AL_LANGUAGE
    CASE "eng"
        RETURNF "The Renov SVG-49, along with the Broughton Model 600 and ArmTeck SPA are one of the three pillars of the Midworld automatic rifle. Using a long-stroke gas pistion system to cycle 7.62x39mm cartridges, it has been proven to be the most reliable blowback system when it comes to use in rough weather and such has been adopted in many countries."
    ENDSELECT
CASE "NAS.trivia.freax"
    SELECTCASE AL_LANGUAGE
    CASE "eng"
        RETURNF "FreaX is a POSIX compataiable computer operation system developed by IEEE Computer Society in 1978 and is the main OS for 90% of computers. Competitor OSes such as CP/M and TheOS flopped compared to POSIX based ones mainly due to the lack of capibility compared to the more advanced POSIX based systems."
    ENDSELECT
ENDSELECT


